Ok, so you are new at the game....

If you want a straight-forward character, that will allow you to explore a 
bit deeper into the game before your ignorance kills you off, you want a 
Valkyrie. Tougher than old boots, very easy style, yummy almost-guaranteed 
artifacts.  But while the trip will be fun, you wont really learn how to 
play Nethack the way it should be played. And you wont learn the skills 
needed for an acsension any time soon.

To learn how to really play the game, and play it well, try a tourist.
Not much fun, and you die very easily. Until you learn how *not* to die.
And at that point the game unfolds grand new vistas that the brute-force 
approach encouraged by the (apparently)easier combat classes newer reaches.

p.s.
Feel free to use online resources, helpfiles etc.. They teach you a lot and 
only slightly spoil the learning experience.
But never, *ever* succumb to the weakness of backup savefiles that grant 
you effective immortality. There is no simpler or surer way of *completely* 
ruining your Nechack experience.



